.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK SQUEAKQL VALIDATE"
.SH NAME
hamstik squeakql validate \- Validate an expression without executing it
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik squeakql validate [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Validate an expression without executing it
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I QUERY
SqueakQL expression (inline)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --file
Read the expression from a file (`-` for stdin) instead of inline
.TP
.B --saved
Run a saved query by name instead of an inline expression
